From 7d829d300dc40088ce8c09c89ab745e989e62083 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Ellis <malard@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:31:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [music][CGUIWindowMusicNav] Open the box sets for the boxsets
 start folder (#29602)

* fixed: open the box sets for the music library's boxsets start folder

CGUIWindowMusicNav::GetStartFolder() mapped "boxsets" to
musicdb://boxsets/, which is no node of the music database directory,
so ActivateWindow(Music,boxsets) opened an empty list. It now maps to
musicdb://albums/?boxset=true, the path the library's own Box sets node
uses.

A test checks that every start folder name the window maps resolves to a
music database node.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* changed: check the boxsets start folder is the box set filter

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

